Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:14.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}前沿 AI 如何改变人们生活的研究。\N{\fs32}research on how frontier AI shapes how we live our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:18.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们相信，这将是现代以来人类生活最重大的变革，\N{\fs32}We are still early in what we believe will be the biggest transformation of the
