Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:40.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}此外，Claude 也可以在 Word、Excel 等企业应用中使用。\N{\fs32}But Claude is also available on enterprise applications like Word and Excel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:43.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们深入各个垂直领域，努力理解：\N{\fs32}We go deep into verticals and try to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:48.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}这个领域的专家，需要什么才能立刻高效开展工作？\N{\fs32}what does an expert in this domain need to be successful immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:52.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}比如，面向律师，我们有 Claude for Legal 套件，\N{\fs32}For instance, if you're a lawyer, we have a Claude for Legal bundle,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:55.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}可以直接连接他们需要的工具。\N{\fs32}which connects directly to the tools you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:59.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们在每个领域都会这样思考。\N{\fs32}This is something we think about for every domain.
