Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:05.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}服务、生命科学等领域的套件。\N{\fs32}services, life sciences, and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:10.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}第二项原则是，模型与产品同步开发。\N{\fs32}Our second principle is that we build models and products side by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:14.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们为未来的模型开发产品，而不仅服务于今天的模型。\N{\fs32}We develop products for tomorrow's models, not just today's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:18.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}Claude Code 就很好地说明了，这为什么重要。\N{\fs32}Claude Code is a great illustration of why that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:22.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}几年前，我们发现尚未发布的\N{\fs32}A couple of years ago, we could see that our prerelease
