Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:28.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}当时还不能包办一切，但我们已经看到了趋势。\N{\fs32}Couldn't quite do it all yet, but we could see the trend line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:32.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们围绕这一判断开发产品，\N{\fs32}We built a product around that thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:35.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}仅仅几个月后，Claude Code 就发布了。\N{\fs32}and Claude Code was launched just a few months later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.09,0:09:39.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}它让人们接触到一种全新的编程方式，\N{\fs32}That introduced people to an entirely new way of coding,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.39,0:09:42.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}也重新认识了 AI 能做到什么。\N{\fs32}and of understanding what AI can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:47.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}模型与产品的这种相互促进，是我们持续开发的长期优势。\N{\fs32}This flywheel between model and product is a durable advantage in how we build.
