Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:51.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们就利用这些进步开发新功能。\N{\fs32}We develop new features powered by those advancements.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:53.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}然后继续训练模型，让它更擅长\N{\fs32}Then we train the models to get even better
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:57.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}完成人们想做的事，从而增强整个系统。\N{\fs32}at what people are trying to do, which reinforces the whole system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:10:00.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}编程如此，其他领域也是如此。\N{\fs32}And we do that in coding and beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:01.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}第三项原则是，\N{\fs32}Our third principle is that we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:05.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}缩小前沿能力与客户日常使用之间的差距。\N{\fs32}close the gap between the frontier and customers day to day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:09.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}多数人仍将 AI 工具视为搜索的替代品，\N{\fs32}Most people still think about their AI tools as a replacement for search
