Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:23.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}正是在这里，产品成为重要的竞争差异。\N{\fs32}This is where product becomes a meaningful competitive differentiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.68,0:10:27.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}如果没有优秀的产品，不断提升的智能水平\N{\fs32}Without a strong product, the difference between growing intelligence
