Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:35.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们认为，未来要让使用 Claude 尽可能简单、\N{\fs32}We think the future will involve making Claude feel as simple
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:40.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}自然，让任何地方的人都能像对待同事一样\N{\fs32}and natural as possible, so people everywhere can just treat Claude
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:44.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}与 Claude 协作，每次都获得高质量的结果。\N{\fs32}the same way you treat a colleague and get high quality output every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:50.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们相信，这三项原则能让前沿智能惠及每个人。\N{\fs32}We think these three principles are how we bring frontier intelligence to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:54.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}这就是我们所说的：赋予人们超能力。\N{\fs32}This is what we mean when we say we want to give people superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:59.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}Claude 首先帮助你，把原本要做的事做得更好、更快。\N{\fs32}Claude starts by helping you do what you need to better and faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:01.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}随后，它会承担起\N{\fs32}Then it takes on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:05.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}那些你过去因为太难、根本不敢尝试的事。\N{\fs32}the things you never would have tried because they were just too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.26,0:11:09.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}未来，这意味着我们每个人都能做到过去不可能的事，\N{\fs32}And in the future, that means all of us doing what used to be impossible
