Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:22.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们意识到，AI 能力可以进步得非常快。\N{\fs32}we realized that AI capabilities could improve very fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:26.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}所以我们创立了 Anthropic：确保 AI 如果成为\N{\fs32}That's why we founded Anthropic to ensure that if AI became
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:30.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}一项变革性技术，也能安全地造福人类。\N{\fs32}a transformational technology, it would be safe and beneficial.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.87,0:11:35.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们的核心判断是，AI 将在这十年取得巨大进步。\N{\fs32}Our fundamental bet is that AI would make tremendous progress this decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:38.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}这些变革性的能力，正是研究\N{\fs32}These transformational capabilities are why research
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:41.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}与安全必须同步推进的原因。\N{\fs32}and safety must advance together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:44.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}唯有如此，我们才能获得这项技术的益处。\N{\fs32}It's the only way we'll realize the benefits of the technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.01,0:11:49.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们从三个维度评估模型：能力、效率，\N{\fs32}We assess our models across three dimensions: capability, efficiency,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:51.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}以及安全性。\N{\fs32}and safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:55.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们优化模型，让它能够准确地规划并完成复杂工作，\N{\fs32}We optimize our models to be able to plan and complete complex work
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:58.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}持续数小时，甚至数天。\N{\fs32}accurately, across hours and even days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:01.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}Opus 5.5 就是个很好的例子。\N{\fs32}A good example is Opus 5.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:05.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}一位用户完成了涉及 68 万行代码的迁移，\N{\fs32}One of our users was able to complete a 680K-line code migration
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:06.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}用时不到一天。\N{\fs32}in less than a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:10.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}而就在几年前，这需要一个工程团队花上数周。\N{\fs32}This would have taken an engineering team weeks just a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:14.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们认为，在这种高度重视准确性的长时间任务上，\N{\fs32}We think our models are the very best at this long horizon work where accuracy
