Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}这种能力始于模型训练过程。\N{\fs32}The capability begins in the model training process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:23.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}在预训练阶段，模型从人类知识的总和中学习：\N{\fs32}In the pre-training phase, a model learns from the totality of human knowledge.
