Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.05,0:12:27.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}图像、科学论文、代码。\N{\fs32}Images, scientific papers, code.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:29.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}在这个阶段，它开始理解——\N{\fs32}This phase is where it comes to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}人类的基本概念和思想。\N{\fs32}fundamental human concepts and ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.18,0:12:35.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}第二个阶段是强化学习。\N{\fs32}The second phase is reinforcement learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:38.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}在这一阶段，Claude 学会做到有益、诚实、无害。\N{\fs32}This is where Claude learns to be helpful, honest, and harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:41.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们在这个阶段激发出它在编程、\N{\fs32}It's where we draw out useful capabilities
