Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:48.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}随着模型从对话助手发展为自主智能体，\N{\fs32}As models have moved from conversational assistance to autonomous agents,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:49.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}强化学习已经成为\N{\fs32}reinforcement learning has evolved
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:52.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们研究投入最大的领域之一。\N{\fs32}into one of the largest areas of research investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:55.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}这个领域对客户确实很重要。\N{\fs32}One that really matters to our customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:58.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}2021 年，我写过一份内部备忘录，\N{\fs32}In 2021, I wrote an internal memo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:13:03.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}提出我们最有可能做出的产品，是一个与人类意图对齐的 AI 程序员。\N{\fs32}outlining how our most likely product might be an aligned AI programmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:07.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我还写了很多其他设想，但这一条后来证明相当准确。\N{\fs32}I wrote a lot of other things too, but this one turned out to be pretty accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.09,0:13:10.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}Claude 的训练过程是 Anthropic 使命不可或缺的一部分。\N{\fs32}Claude's training process is integral to Anthropic's mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.51,0:13:13.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们需要理解如何训练前沿智能，\N{\fs32}We need to understand how to train frontier intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:14.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}以及如何确保它的安全。\N{\fs32}and how to make it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:17.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}这也是我们实现 AI 价值的方式。\N{\fs32}And this is how we deliver the benefits of AI.
