Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:30.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}在 Anthropic 投入一美元算力，比在其他任何前沿实验室都更有效。\N{\fs32}of compute at Anthropic goes further than a dollar at any other frontier lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:32.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们通过两种方式建立了这一优势。\N{\fs32}We've achieved that advantage in two ways.
