Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:37.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们拥有一套自主研发的芯片适配和部署方法。\N{\fs32}Our proprietary approach to bringing up and deploying silicon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:41.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}如今，我们在四大类芯片上训练 Claude 并提供服务。\N{\fs32}We train and serve Claude now across all four major chip families.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.82,0:19:45.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}之所以能做到，是因为我们很早就做出了一个非主流的选择：\N{\fs32}That's only possible because early on, we made an unconventional bet
