Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:02.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}如今，我们已经积累了多年经验，并且非常擅长这项工作。\N{\fs32}We've now been doing it for years, and we've gotten incredibly good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.84,0:20:06.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}这带来了两项关键优势。在算力供应紧张的市场中，\N{\fs32}This comes with two key advantages. In a supply-constrained compute market,
