Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:12.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}让我们能够专注于最佳性价比，而不受供应商限制。\N{\fs32}allows us to focus on the best price performance regardless of the provider.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:15.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们可以把每种芯片用在它最擅长的任务上。\N{\fs32}We can match each chip to the job that it's best at.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.69,0:20:18.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}有的更适合训练，有的更适合推理。\N{\fs32}Some are better at training, some are better at inference.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:22.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}借助多芯片策略，我们可以把来自不同\N{\fs32}Our multi-silicon chip strategy means we can treat all of our chips across
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:27.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}供应商、架构和地点的所有芯片，视为一个可灵活调配的算力池。\N{\fs32}providers, architectures and locations as one fungible pool of compute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:30.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}这也让我们非常擅长适配新芯片。\N{\fs32}This has also made us really good at bringing up new chips.
