Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:42.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}这一次，我们让 Mythos 来试一试。\N{\fs32}This time we had Mythos try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:46.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}结果只用了三天，它就让 Claude 在 AMD 芯片上运行起来，\N{\fs32}It got Claude running on AMD in just three days with basically
