Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:50.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}几乎 100% 的计算内核都由 Claude 移植或编写。\N{\fs32}Claude ported or wrote almost 100% of the kernels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:54.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}对于承载这些芯片的数据中心，我们也有独特的策略。\N{\fs32}We also have a distinct approach to the data centers that house our chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:57.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}过去，我们以云服务的形式购买算力。\N{\fs32}Historically, we bought compute as a cloud service.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:21:00.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}如今，我们增加了第二种方式：租用芯片，\N{\fs32}We've now added a second approach where we lease chips
