Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:46.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}或者，你可以用这 100 单位物理算力，训练出一个更智能的模型，\N{\fs32}Or you can use those 100 physical units to train an even more intelligent model
