Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:54.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}它们能在彼此的基础上不断积累。\N{\fs32}They build on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:56.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}我们发现的每一种新的增效方法，\N{\fs32}Each new multiplier we
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:59.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,{\fs42}都会对之前的方法产生正面作用，它们可以叠加。\N{\fs32}discover has a positive effect on the multipliers before it. They stack.
